<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>MLBB Basics</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-frame">
      <div class="browser-window">
        <header class="browser-header">
          <div class="brand">MLBB BASICS</div>
          <nav class="nav">
            <a href="#">Home</a>
            <a href="#">Game Basics</a>
            <a href="#">Heroes &amp; Roles</a>
            <a href="#">Map &amp; Lanes</a>
            <a href="#">Items &amp; Skills</a>
            <a href="#">Objectives</a>
            <a href="#">Tips</a>
          </nav>
        </header>

        <main class="hero">
          <div class="hero-background"></div>
          <section class="card-grid" aria-label="Guide topics">
            <article class="card card-top-left">
              <h2>Game Basics</h2>
              <p>Learn how a match unfolds, earn gold and experience, and work with your team to destroy the enemy base.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card card-top-right">
              <h2>Heroes &amp; Roles</h2>
              <p>Explore Tank, Fighter, Assassin, Mage, Marksman and Support heroes, and find the role that suits your play style.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card card-bottom-left">
              <h2>Map &amp; Lanes</h2>
              <p>Get familiar with the three lanes, jungle paths and team bases, and learn where to go during each stage of the game.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card card-bottom-right">
              <h2>Items &amp; Skills</h2>
              <p>Choose items to strengthen your hero, upgrade abilities as you level up, and adapt your build to the match.</p>
            </article>
          </section>
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <h1>Mobile Legends: Bang Bang</h1>
            <p>A simple guide to the game's basic mechanics</p>
          </div>
        </main>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
